 welcome to a tale of forests! Of dreadful villains! Of caterpillars called Graham! And of a great big BEEFER of a cherry tree!\n\nBut what dark secrets are hidden in that tree, where the leaves grow thick and green? Polly intends to find out, and she intends to find out by finding out. What will she find out? Find out by listening to this audiobook, and you’ll find out! NEEEEIIIIGGGGH!","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/6cf89344938084f1b92219093d02902dd188ec2aaf672f74a5a482d7c8844d80/kcoAiNHx-JIzUh6h7iSE7isYqiTYrdiX-mqjLWH-Qps.mp3","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/MwdRIrvllDrkVuR5VmGj2sbkgt8u1TYrawNDZU3n0Es"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":4785,"fileSize":77579323,"hasStreams":false},"status":{"name":"complete","updatedAt":"2021-04-09T15:51:41.045Z"}},"cardId":"xH7aQ","createdAt":"2020-10-16T11:30:52.782Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-05T17:46:38.108Z","clubAvailability":[],"sortkey":"mr-gum-and-the-cherry-tree"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}